SUMMARY:[AI ADJUSTED] running — 10K Race: start at 5:50/km for the first 
 3km\, build to 5:35/
DESCRIPTION:10K Race: start at 5:50/km for the first 3km\, build to 5:35/km
  if feeling strong from 5km onward — treat as a fitness benchmark rather
  than a peak performance\, and cap effort at a hard but controlled RPE 8.\
 n\nReason: With zero logged training data over the last 4 weeks\, there is
  no evidence of readiness to execute a maximum-effort race\; a controlled 
 effort protects against injury and still yields useful marathon-pace data 
 92 days out.\n\nAI coaching 2026-11-07
END:VEVENT
